The Rustica fox (2026-11-25), from the project owner's concept:

  fox.svg           the fox's head, filled, with its eyes cut out (the
                    panel's menu button draws the same shape: rustica-ui
                    ui.rs FOX_OUTLINE, FOX_EYES)
  fox-outline.svg   the same as an outline
  fox-256.png       fox.svg at 256 pixels

Its colour is the brand's orange, #FF6500, in every theme.

themes/           the colour themes (docs/SESSION.md "Themes")
logo.png, photo.jpg   test pictures (uidemo, run-openwith-test.sh)
